        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibeedeayda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweaydeaba shageash bea sugoocheanduumeadaanyi, bea sheedeaba damanamughuush, bea eaweedeaba damanamughuush bea sheeda. Hean ghwahidu Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli sea lugoadaanyi sean, gang'uchi sea Yerusalemu, ak ghamiinda maheemajeagaaschi gwaneaweesa mujiini, nea ghwadeas ghamarda aba meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeneaweesa mujiini ea ghoah gweaydeaba damwanagi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Sedekiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedeaba shageash bea sheedeaba ang'wan abeeda ea ning'eat geejeeda ng'waan aba mujiini, ak buuneeda ea mandeawana hamita aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geenyarja meatkweenagi bea ghamarda mujiini, ak gamng'aw sugoocheanda sea fuga sean bea ng'ucheeda eawa nea gwasik naweeda mida dageascheeda ghamardida asiyeenya mida murdeeda boostaaneeda Ng'utamiida. Abeeda fuga Galdayo gwaneaweesa mujiini meadajeega sean, hean geeweay nea geayaat naweeda gal Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadas geeshta sugoocheanda lugooda fuga Galdayo, ak geeruudu aba mooheeda Yeriko. Nea lugoadaanyi sean ea nidarda ak geanung'wa heeda niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'waay sugoocheanda, ak geayaat heeda sugoocheanda Babeli mida Ribla, amang'ata geergweaksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geabwar orjooga Sedekiya aba madeadaanyi amang'ata geenyarja gheanyanga Sedekiya, ak gearat aba biingu, ak geayaat ea eahita Babeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyarjeawda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedeaba ispwa bea sheedeaba muut nea gweaydeaba damwan shageash gil bea sugoocheanduumeeda Nebukadinesa sugoocheanda Babeli. Hean gawa Yerusalemu Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ambal shirikareeda furiischi, ea siida gadiyeeda gheeda sugoocheanda Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaghwarda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gheeda sugoocheanda, ea gealga sean mida Yerusalemu, nea ghaghwarda eara gealga hees sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu lugooda sean bea fuga Galdayo mideayi sea shirikarajeanda haw ambal shirikareeda furiischi. Hean gwanyarja ghamarda neaweesa Yerusalemu meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea boosteanga buuneeda sinung'usa mujiiniin ea giika ng'waardaan, ak gamng'awsa sugoocheanda Babeli, ea boosteanga sean bea buuneesuurja, fiisu goobaleak Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ambal shirikareeda furiischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak shirikarajeandida haw ambal shirikareeda furiischiin, ghwanung'wa heeda fiisu ng'ay barbari jea gang'ula sabiibu nea ghabwar ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Galdayo gwahirjeaweada daranajeega oomng'i mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea hoorgajeega oomng'i bea basooda mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gageanda gharingiga oomng'i ghwaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara furinyajeega, ea mageemboojiga makaasajeega, ea matiingwajeega, ea dabita sean oomng'i ghayi sigadiyeata aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA geegeanda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga ghwaat sean eara furinyajeega sean, ea bakurajeega, ea dabita sisna dahaabu siguura dahaabu, ea gea sisna lagheanga sisina lapiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daranajeega asiyeenyean ea basoodida asagiin ea hoorgajeegiga ghayi sin Sulemani aba gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak dabidi oomng'i seaniin ea manda durumanata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daraneanagi geawundaanyi geatin damwan sis gil, ak uhuudaanyi ea oomu, nea geawunda uhuudaanyi ea geatin samwagu gil, ak uhuudaanyi gwanda gheareedanga ea goomamanga gwaneaweesa uhuudaanyi sean, ak ea oomng'i sean. Nea eara daraneedeaba iyeenya gwasunu, eara ada gwanda uhuuda gheareedanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Yuda geayaat Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga, Seraya was ashoohoocheanda haw, ea Sefaniya was ashoohoocheandeaba iyeenya. Ea furiischoodigiga bea gidaghuudiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu aba jeeda mujiini siida ambaliischi was shirikarajeanda haw bea fuga ng'ucheeda, ea fih muut argweakiisa buuneeda aba madeeda sugoocheanda, ea gea nyaah mujiini, ea ng'oorshoocheanda, shirikarajeanda haw ambal shirikara nea ghang'oar fuga ng'eanyiida ea fih laadam bea ng'eanyiida nyasa jeeda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga, ghoang'waay saawa ak gweadu saawa heeda sugoocheanda Babeli mida Ribla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghabwar sugoocheanda Babeli saawa, ea gwanuus aba Ribla mida ng'eanyiida Hamati. Hean iidu fuga Yuda geang'aamwa ng'eanyiida nyaawa ak geepaleak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedaliya sugoocheanda haw bea Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga sinung'wa ng'eanyiida Yuda nung'wa heeda Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli. Hean ghwayiin Nebukadinesa Gedaliya orjeeda Ahikamu bea Shafani ghoah sugoocheanda nyaawa haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu nea ghwayiiy shirikarajeega hees sean ambal shirikara, mida mooheeda, sea fuga nyaawa gideaba sugoocheanda Babeli niyiin Gedaliya ghoah sugoocheanda haw. Hean geapka sea fuga nyaawa heeda Gedaliya aba Mispa; nea geaba Shumwaheeli gil was orjeeda Netaniya, ea Yohana orjeeda Gareya, ea Seraya orjeeda Danhumeti bea Netofa ea Yesaniya orjeeda Maaka, saawa ea fuga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweaksa Gedaliya habeawooda saawa ea fuga nyaawa, nea gwayeesha, “Adoabeali aba fuga hees bea Galdayo. Oopiidana jeeda ng'eanyiida, nea googadiyeesi sugoocheanda Babeli, ak ghoadoabiiw aba heedeang'wa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sheedeaba ispwa gaweesa Gedaliya Shumwaheeli was orjeeda Netaniya, bea Elishama, bea dooshta sugoocheanda, sea fih damanamughuush ak geabwar Gedaliya ea ghami, ea fuga Yahudi ea gea Galdayo ghayi mideayi aba Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat ng'eat fuga sean manang'i ea gea hees, ea shirikarajeega hees ambal shirikara, ak geeweay ng'eanyiida Misri aba gideaba geawal fuga Galdayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini geesiksa aba ghealooniga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
