          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweaydeaba diktam ea damanispwa siipaleaga Yehoyakini was sugoocheanda Yuda, bea sheedeaba damaniyeenya, eaweedeaba diktam ea ispwa bea sheeda. Efil-merodaki was sugoocheanda Babeli, hean gweayda madeeda bea sugoocheanduumeadaanyi hean gwasiksa Yehoyakini was sugoocheanda Yuda aba ghealooniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobaloola niny ng'asheega miyaas, ak ghoadaw niny hawunda sugoocheanduumeeda ea ghoanaawa sugoodiga mideayi sea niny aba Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu Yehoyakini ghafwakta hang'weakiga bea ghealoonigean. Nea gweagiisachi galeagasean aba gheeh sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa galeagasean gilinyoo gagasa sean ghoadaw sugoocheanda, aba jeeda giibindaanyi sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
